  "description": "Development-only compile-time rules for Solhigson projects: the IDE style rules with a fixer at warning in a packaged .globalconfig, superseded APIs in a BannedSymbols.txt under Microsoft.CodeAnalysis.BannedApiAnalyzers, the SOLT test-class analyzers, and the SOLT settings declaration analyzers, which hold each [Setting] property to the settings catalog's declaration rules.",
